{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"colorful-icons","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Colorful Icons","description":"Every kind of file has its own color: orange for Rust, blue for TypeScript, yellow for JavaScript.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"iconThemes":[{"id":"colorful-icons","label":"Colorful Icons","path":"icons/colorful-icons.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"icons/colorful-icons.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"folder\": {\n    \"icon\": \"folder\",\n    \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n  },\n  \"folderOpen\": {\n    \"icon\": \"folder-opened\",\n    \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n  },\n  \"file\": {\n    \"icon\": \"file\",\n    \"color\": \"#9aa5b1\"\n  },\n  \"extensions\": {\n    \"rs\": {\n      \"icon\": \"gear\",\n      \"color\": \"#ff7043\"\n    },\n    \"ts\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-namespace\",\n      \"color\": \"#3178c6\"\n    },\n    \"tsx\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-namespace\",\n      \"color\": \"#3fa9f5\"\n    },\n    \"js\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-method\",\n      \"color\": \"#f7df1e\"\n    },\n    \"jsx\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-method\",\n      \"color\": \"#61dafb\"\n    },\n    \"json\": {\n      \"icon\": \"json\",\n      \"color\": \"#f5c518\"\n    },\n    \"py\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-misc\",\n      \"color\": \"#4b8bbe\"\n    },\n    \"md\": {\n      \"icon\": \"markdown\",\n      \"color\": \"#42a5f5\"\n    },\n    \"html\": {\n      \"icon\": \"code\",\n      \"color\": \"#e44d26\"\n    },\n    \"css\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-color\",\n      \"color\": \"#2965f1\"\n    },\n    \"scss\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-color\",\n      \"color\": \"#cd6799\"\n    },\n    \"png\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-media\",\n      \"color\": \"#26a69a\"\n    },\n    \"jpg\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-media\",\n      \"color\": \"#26a69a\"\n    },\n    \"svg\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-media\",\n      \"color\": \"#ffb13b\"\n    },\n    \"gif\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-media\",\n      \"color\": \"#26a69a\"\n    },\n    \"toml\": {\n      \"icon\": \"settings-gear\",\n      \"color\": \"#9c6b4e\"\n    },\n    \"yml\": {\n      \"icon\": \"settings-gear\",\n      \"color\": \"#cb171e\"\n    },\n    \"yaml\": {\n      \"icon\": \"settings-gear\",\n      \"color\": \"#cb171e\"\n    },\n    \"lock\": {\n      \"icon\": \"lock\",\n      \"color\": \"#8d8d8d\"\n    },\n    \"sh\": {\n      \"icon\": \"terminal\",\n      \"color\": \"#89e051\"\n    },\n    \"ps1\": {\n      \"icon\": \"terminal\",\n      \"color\": \"#5391fe\"\n    },\n    \"bat\": {\n      \"icon\": \"terminal\",\n      \"color\": \"#c1f12e\"\n    },\n    \"go\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-method\",\n      \"color\": \"#00add8\"\n    },\n    \"java\": {\n      \"icon\": \"coffee\",\n      \"color\": \"#e76f00\"\n    },\n    \"kt\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-class\",\n      \"color\": \"#a97bff\"\n    },\n    \"swift\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-class\",\n      \"color\": \"#fa7343\"\n    },\n    \"php\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-misc\",\n      \"color\": \"#777bb4\"\n    },\n    \"rb\": {\n      \"icon\": \"ruby\",\n      \"color\": \"#cc342d\"\n    },\n    \"c\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-ruler\",\n      \"color\": \"#5c6bc0\"\n    },\n    \"cpp\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-ruler\",\n      \"color\": \"#00599c\"\n    },\n    \"h\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-ruler\",\n      \"color\": \"#7986cb\"\n    },\n    \"sql\": {\n      \"icon\": \"database\",\n      \"color\": \"#e38c00\"\n    },\n    \"zip\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-zip\",\n      \"color\": \"#a1887f\"\n    },\n    \"pdf\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-pdf\",\n      \"color\": \"#e53935\"\n    },\n    \"txt\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-text\",\n      \"color\": \"#bdbdbd\"\n    },\n    \"log\": {\n      \"icon\": \"output\",\n      \"color\": \"#90a4ae\"\n    },\n    \"env\": {\n      \"icon\": \"key\",\n      \"color\": \"#ecd53f\"\n    },\n    \"vue\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-namespace\",\n      \"color\": \"#41b883\"\n    },\n    \"svelte\": {\n      \"icon\": \"symbol-namespace\",\n      \"color\": \"#ff3e00\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"names\": {\n    \"package.json\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \"cargo.toml\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \"composer.json\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \"dockerfile\": {\n      \"icon\": \"server-environment\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \"readme.md\": {\n      \"icon\": \"book\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \"license\": {\n      \"icon\": \"law\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \"makefile\": {\n      \"icon\": \"tools\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \".gitignore\": {\n      \"icon\": \"source-control\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    },\n    \".env\": {\n      \"icon\": \"key\",\n      \"color\": \"#e0a458\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"folderNames\": {\n    \"src\": {\n      \"icon\": \"folder-library\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"docs\": {\n      \"icon\": \"book\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"icon\": \"beaker\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"tests\": {\n      \"icon\": \"beaker\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"public\": {\n      \"icon\": \"globe\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"assets\": {\n      \"icon\": \"file-media\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"node_modules\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \".git\": {\n      \"icon\": \"source-control\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \".github\": {\n      \"icon\": \"github\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"dist\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"build\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    },\n    \"target\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#f0a24a\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Colorful Icons\n\nEvery kind of file has its own color: orange for Rust, blue for TypeScript, yellow for JavaScript.\n\nInstall it, then choose **Colorful Icons** in **Settings > File icon theme**.\n\nIt covers about 40 kinds of files and a set of well known folders such as `src`, `docs` and `tests`. It runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}